  "principles": [
    "One truth. Many topologies. No duplicate truth.",
    "Function boundaries remain Event-mediated.",
    "function_call remains forbidden.",
    "logic op=call remains forbidden.",
    "READY is runtime readiness and is not boolean truth.",
    "Modeling an Effect does not grant runtime authority.",
    "Dynamic dispatch cannot target outside an explicit canonical domain.",
    "LOCKED requires human validation and is not produced by this decision report."
